{{ ref: ada8c606-0f08-4dd3-aa9f-001a3802a3df }}
- **Description**: Visibility is derived, never declared: each symbol's export scope is the lowest container ancestor covering all its consumers, widened by the transitive type-exposure fixpoint. Test code is projected, not optimized: specs follow their subjects under the detected per-package convention, helpers cluster inside the test polarity zone, and any production → test edge is a hard violation (AD-3).
--{ ref: ada8c606-0f08-4dd3-aa9f-001a3802a3df }--

